翼請為司馬及軍司，並不肯赴。翼遺浩書，因致其意。先是，浩父羨為長沙，在郡貪殘，，兄冰與翼書屬之。翼報曰：「殷君始往，雖多驕豪，實有風力之益，亦似由有佳兒、弟，故不令物情難之。自頃以來，奉公更退，私累日滋，亦不稍以此寥蕭之也。既雅敬洪遠，又與浩親善，其父兄得失，豈以小小計之。大較江東政，以傴儛豪強，以為民蠹，時有行法，輒施之寒劣。如往年偷石頭倉米一百萬斛，皆是豪將輩，而直打殺倉督監以塞責。山遐作余姚鬥年，而為官出二千戶，政雖不倫，公強官長也，而群共驅之，，不得安席。紀睦、徐甯奉王使糾罪人，船頭到渚，桓逸還復，而二使免官。雖皆前宰之惛謬，江東事去，實此之由也。兄弟不幸，橫陷此中，自不能拔腳於風塵之外，當共明目而治之。荊州所統一二十郡，唯長沙最惡。惡而不黜，與殺督監者復何異耶！」翼有風力格裁，發言立論皆如此。","source_position":{"rendered_tool_line":251,"received_block_sha256":"485412e61c821a8b865f644cc0154001e684a057776e6d29e54f1f4a13b753d3"},"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-073-yuyi-ws2296501-rendered:p004:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"殷浩","kind":"person","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"yinhao","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin073-yuyi-ws2296501/textual-decisions.json#yinhao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-073-yuyi-ws2296501-rendered:p004:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"翼","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_F","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"yi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin073-yuyi-ws2296501/textual-decisions.json#yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-073-yuyi-ws2296501-rendered:p004:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"翼","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_F","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"yi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin073-yuyi-ws2296501/textual-decisions.json#yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-073-yuyi-ws2296501-rendered:p004:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"浩","kind":"person","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"yinhao","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin073-yuyi-ws2296501/textual-decisions.json#yinhao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-073-yuyi-ws2296501-rendered:p004:m0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"浩","kind":"person","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"yinhao","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin073-yuyi-ws2296501/textual