on_id":"wa4_ryp_uum","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331"},{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p041","text":"徐寧者，東海郯人也。少知名，為輿縣令。時廷尉桓彝稱有人倫鑒識，彝嘗去職，至廣陵尋親舊，還遇風，停浦中，累日憂悒，因上岸，見一室宇，有似廨署，訪之，云是輿縣。彝乃造之。甯清惠博涉，相遇欣然，因留數夕。彝大賞之，結交而別。至都，謂庾亮曰：「吾為卿得一佳吏部郎。」語在〈彝傳〉。即遷吏部郎、左將軍、江州刺史，卒官。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1536331-raw.wikitext","raw_start":9500,"raw_end":9660,"character_positions":[9502,9503,9504,9505,9506,9507,9508,9509,9510,9511,9512,9513,9514,9515,9516,9517,9518,9519,9520,9521,9522,9523,9524,9525,9526,9527,9528,9529,9530,9531,9532,9533,9534,9535,9536,9537,9538,9539,9540,9541,9542,9543,9544,9545,9546,9547,9548,9549,9550,9551,9552,9553,9554,9555,9556,9557,9558,9559,9560,9561,9562,9563,9564,9565,9566,9567,9568,9569,9570,9571,9572,9573,9574,9577,9580,9581,9582,9583,9584,9585,9586,9587,9588,9589,9590,9591,9592,9593,9594,9595,9596,9597,9598,9599,9600,9601,9602,9603,9604,9605,9606,9607,9608,9609,9610,9611,9612,9613,9614,9615,9616,9617,9618,9619,9620,9621,9622,9623,9624,9625,9626,9627,9628,9629,9630,9631,9632,9633,9634,9635,9636,9637,9638,9639,9640,9641,9642,9643,9644,9645,9646,9647,9648,9649,9650,9651,9652,9653,9654,9655,9656,9657,9658,9659]},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p041:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"徐寧","kind":"person","person_id":"wa4_ryp_uum","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p041:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"桓彝","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p041:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"彝","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來